"""Topic-specific unit briefs, authored for each of the 33 courses."""
COURSES={}
def C(cid, focus, group, units):
    rows=[]
    for line in units.strip().splitlines():
        key,title,context=line.split('|')
        rows.append(dict(key=key,title=title,context=context))
    assert len(rows)==10,(cid,len(rows))
    COURSES[cid]=dict(focus=focus,group=group,units=rows)

C('b368','由速度規畫到停準驗證的自動駕駛閉迴路~Automatic-driving feedback from speed planning to stopping verification','control',r'''
braking|停準制動軌跡~Stopping brake trajectory|本單元比較相同站距下的早煞與晚煞軌跡，將停車位置誤差分成延遲與制動能力兩部分。~Compare early and late braking over the same approach, separating stopping-position error caused by latency from error caused by available deceleration.
jerk|舒適加速度過渡~Comfortable acceleration transitions|本單元把加速度命令的斜坡與站立乘客的短時擾動連結，明確區分平滑命令與平滑實際反應。~Relate the acceleration-command ramp to short transient disturbance for standing passengers, distinguishing a smooth requested command from a smooth measured response.
traction|牽引力功率限制~Traction force and power limits|本單元比較定力區與功率受限區的加速需求，檢查速度規畫是否要求致動器無法提供的力。~Compare acceleration demand in force-limited and power-limited regions, checking whether a speed plan asks for more force than the actuator can deliver.
energy|節能滑行與回生~Coasting and regenerative energy|本單元以同一抵達時刻比較滑行與回生的能量帳，將準點需求和可受納回生能量分開記錄。~Compare coasting and regeneration for an identical arrival time, keeping punctuality requirements separate from the energy that the receiving supply can accept.
position_latency|地標資料年齡~Age of landmark observations|本單元追蹤地標通過到速度控制器採用資料的時間，避免把高定位精度誤認為低控制延遲。~Track time from landmark passage to use by the speed controller, avoiding confusion between precise positioning and low control-loop latency.
dwell|關門發車介面~Door closure and departure interface|本單元分析旅客服務結束到發車條件成立的交接，車門狀態只是必要輸入而不是獨立發車授權。~Analyse the handoff from completed passenger service to departure readiness; door status is a necessary input rather than an independent departure authority.
latency_sum|速度閉迴路時序~Speed-loop timing budget|本單元把速度感測、通訊、控制計算與牽引建立串成同一事件鏈，尋找真正限制反應的階段。~Link speed sensing, communication, control computation and traction build-up into one event chain to identify the stage that actually limits response.
coverage|駕駛模式交接驗證~Driving-mode handover verification|本單元建立自動與人工駕駛模式的需求案例矩陣，對不完整交接保留明確狀態而不猜測完成。~Build a requirement-case matrix for automatic and manual mode transitions, retaining an explicit incomplete state rather than inferring a successful handover.
availability|自動駕駛服務恢復~Automatic-operation service recovery|本單元比較短暫模式退出與長時間設備維修的服務影響，避免把可用度當作行車安全證明。~Compare service effects of brief mode withdrawals and lengthy equipment repairs, avoiding the use of availability as proof of operating safety.
confidence_zero|停準重複試驗推論~Inference from repeated stopping tests|本單元把停準測試的零失敗紀錄轉成有限的統計證據，明列載重、黏著與車型抽樣範圍。~Turn a failure-free stopping-test record into bounded statistical evidence, explicitly defining the sampled loads, adhesion conditions and vehicle types.
''')
C('b369','列車監督排程與旅客資訊的一致性~Consistency of train supervision scheduling and passenger information','control',r'''
headway|班距監督與瓶頸~Headway supervision and bottlenecks|本單元以月台占用和區間追蹤兩個資源比較班距，先找瓶頸再討論監督系統可調整的空間。~Compare platform occupation and open-line following as separate headway resources, identifying the bottleneck before considering what supervision can adjust.
timetable_slack|時刻偏差吸收~Absorbing timetable deviation|本單元將提前、延誤與可用餘裕列在同一時空圖，防止同一段緩衝被多項調整重複使用。~Place early running, delay and available margin on one time-distance diagram so several adjustments cannot silently consume the same recovery buffer.
dwell|停站延長決策~Dwell-extension decisions|本單元比較延長停站接續轉乘與保持後車間距的衝突，把旅客服務目標與線路容量一起呈現。~Compare holding a train for connections with preserving separation from its follower, presenting passenger-service objectives alongside the route-capacity consequences.
queue|旅客服務需求累積~Accumulation of passenger service demand|本單元以旅客請求進出服務區的模型觀察需求累積，將未服務旅客保留在資料中而非刪除。~Use passenger entry and exit from a service area to observe demand accumulation, retaining unserved travellers in the data instead of removing them.
throughput|監督訊息頻寬~Supervisory message bandwidth|本單元統計多列車位置與狀態更新的通訊需求，分別比較同步推送和錯開傳送造成的佇列。~Account for position and status updates from many trains, comparing the queueing effects of synchronized reports with deliberately staggered transmission.
clock|到發時間共同時基~Common timebase for arrivals|本單元檢查行控紀錄和車站資訊系統是否使用一致時間，避免把時鐘漂移解讀成準點率變化。~Check whether control logs and station information share a consistent timebase, avoiding interpretation of clock drift as a change in punctuality.
alarm_rate|營運異常警報排序~Ordering operational alarms|本單元將重複延誤警報與真正不同的設備異常分開，讓操作員看見原因鏈而非只看警報數。~Separate duplicate delay alarms from distinct equipment anomalies so operators can understand the causal chain rather than merely the alarm count.
state_space|列車任務狀態管理~Managing train-mission states|本單元列舉上線、停駛與任務交接的合法狀態，檢查同一列車是否被分配互斥任務。~Enumerate valid entry, withdrawal and assignment states, checking whether one train has accidentally been allocated mutually incompatible missions.
coverage|旅客資訊一致性~Passenger-information consistency|本單元把月台顯示、車內播報與行控排程連成案例矩陣，要求每項更新能追溯同一版本。~Connect platform displays, onboard announcements and control schedules in a case matrix, requiring each update to trace to one consistent version.
test_time|監督整合重播計畫~Supervision integration replay plan|本單元安排整日營運事件的縮時重播，將重置環境、保存證據和異常重測納入測試工時。~Plan accelerated replay of a full operating day, including environment reset, evidence preservation and anomaly reruns in the test-effort budget.
''')
C('b370','無線列控資料可信度與端到端時間邊界~Trustworthy radio train-control data and end-to-end timing bounds','control',r'''
position_latency|位置回報時效邊界~Position-report freshness bounds|本單元將回報的位置誤差與車輛在傳輸期間前進的距離合併，保持量測時刻的可追溯性。~Combine reported-position uncertainty with vehicle travel during transmission, preserving traceability to the original measurement instant rather than reception alone.
latency_sum|車地控制時序鏈~Train-to-wayside timing chain|本單元沿感測、車載處理、無線網路與地面處理追蹤事件，不用各設備平均值代替整體尾端。~Trace an event through sensing, onboard processing, radio and wayside processing without replacing end-to-end tail behaviour with subsystem averages.
packet_loss|無線成串遺失~Bursts of radio packet loss|本單元比較獨立丟包與隧道遮蔽造成的連續失聯，判斷重送策略是否犧牲資料新鮮度。~Compare independent losses with continuous outages caused by tunnel obstruction, asking whether retransmission trades away the freshness of control information.
throughput|多車共用頻道~Many trains sharing a channel|本單元估算尖峰列車數下的訊息負載，加入協定開銷並檢查同步回報時的短暫壅塞。~Estimate message demand at peak train count, include protocol overhead, and examine temporary congestion when trains report at the same instant.
headway|移動間隔概念模型~Conceptual moving separation|本單元把列車長度、防護距離與路徑釋放時間轉為時間資源，明確區分概念模型與實際行車規則。~Convert train length, protected distance and route-release time into a time resource, explicitly separating a teaching model from real operating rules.
clock|分散時鐘一致性~Consistency of distributed clocks|本單元比較車載與地面時間戳的漂移，檢查資料排序是否可能因校時跳變而顛倒。~Compare drift between onboard and wayside timestamps and examine whether a synchronization jump could reverse apparent event order.
redundancy|無線備援共同原因~Common causes in radio redundancy|本單元檢查雙無線路徑是否仍共用電源、天線位置或軟體，將共同原因從獨立丟包中分離。~Examine whether duplicated radio paths still share power, antenna location or software, separating common causes from independent packet losses.
state_space|模式與有效性旗標~Modes and validity flags|本單元把模式、位置有效性和資料時效視為不同狀態，不讓某個正常旗標掩蓋其他未知資訊。~Treat operating mode, position validity and data age as separate states so one normal flag cannot conceal uncertainty in another input.
coverage|無線交接案例矩陣~Radio-handover case matrix|本單元用離線重播覆蓋基地台交接邊界、重複資料與亂序資料，保留每項需求的判定證據。~Use offline replay to cover access-point handover boundaries, duplicated data and out-of-order messages, retaining evidence for every requirement decision.
confidence_zero|通訊試驗證據界限~Limits of communication-test evidence|本單元檢查大量成功封包是否其實集中在少數容易場景，將統計推論限制在真正抽樣的環境。~Check whether many successful packets came from only a few easy scenarios, limiting statistical inference to the environments genuinely represented by the sample.
''')
C('b371','歐洲列控版本介面與車地相容驗證~European train-control version interfaces and train–track compatibility','control',r'''
braking|列控制動模型輸入~Train-control braking-model inputs|本單元以簡化制動距離理解速度、反應時間與減速度的角色，避免將教材算例當成列控制動曲線。~Use simplified stopping distance to understand speed, response and deceleration, without treating a teaching calculation as an operational ETCS braking curve.
position_latency|應答器位置與時效~Balise position and data freshness|本單元區分地標參考點的定位誤差與車載處理時間，追蹤資料從讀取到採用的整個路徑。~Separate reference-point uncertainty from onboard processing time, tracing the complete path from landmark reading to use in the train-control calculation.
odometry|應答器間里程漂移~Odometry drift between balises|本單元比較兩個地標之間的距離累積誤差，將輪徑比例偏差與單次地標校正偏移分開。~Compare distance accumulation between landmarks, separating wheel-scale bias from the one-time offset introduced by a landmark correction.
latency_sum|車地資料交接~Train–track data handoff|本單元為讀取、驗證、轉換與採用定義一致起訖，確保各供應商的介面延遲不會漏算。~Define consistent start and finish events for reading, validation, conversion and use so interface latency between suppliers is not omitted.
state_space|模式轉換可達性~Reachability of mode transitions|本單元在抽象狀態機中檢查合法轉換與拒絕轉換，不把版本名稱相同當作所有行為相容的證據。~Check allowed and rejected transitions in an abstract state machine, without treating a shared version name as proof that every behaviour is compatible.
coverage|版本相容需求矩陣~Version-compatibility requirement matrix|本單元把車載版本、地面版本與功能需求分別列出，避免只測一種搭配就推論全網互通。~List onboard version, trackside version and functional requirements separately, avoiding network-wide interoperability claims from testing one combination.
fault_union|介面失配頂事件~Top event for interface mismatch|本單元把資料語意與設定檔錯配作為不同候選原因，先建立失效邏輯再討論假想機率。~Treat semantic mismatch and configuration mismatch as distinct candidate causes, defining fault logic before assigning hypothetical probabilities.
clock|測試記錄時間對齊~Aligning integration-test clocks|本單元比較車載、地面和測試儀紀錄的時間差，避免把儀器時基誤差當成系統反應延遲。~Compare timestamps from onboard equipment, wayside equipment and test instruments, avoiding confusion between reference-clock error and system response delay.
test_time|跨版本回歸測試~Cross-version regression testing|本單元為每種版本組合保留環境還原與資料核對時間，明確追蹤變更後哪些證據需要重新取得。~Budget restoration and data checks for every version combination, explicitly tracking which evidence must be regenerated after a change.
confidence_zero|互通試驗推論範圍~Scope of interoperability inference|本單元把成功試驗限制在已測功能與版本集合，說明零失敗紀錄不能外推到未測國別或設備。~Limit successful-test inference to the tested function and version set, explaining why a zero-failure record does not cover untested national or equipment variants.
''')
C('b372','互斥進路與狀態轉移的可驗證聯鎖~Verifiable interlocking of conflicting routes and state transitions','control',r'''
state_space|聯鎖布林狀態空間~Boolean interlocking state space|本單元以小型離線車站模型列舉占用、鎖閉和進路旗標，檢查不可能同時成立的組合。~Enumerate occupancy, locking and route flags in a small offline station model, checking combinations that must never be true simultaneously.
fault_union|互斥進路失效樹~Fault tree for conflicting routes|本單元把錯誤輸入、邏輯缺陷與介面失配分開列為原因，不以單一設備正常取代整體論證。~Separate bad inputs, logic defects and interface mismatches as causes, rather than substituting one healthy device for a system-level argument.
redundancy|雙通道邏輯共同原因~Common causes in dual-channel logic|本單元檢查兩個運算通道是否共享相同需求錯誤，將設計多樣性與硬體複製明確分開。~Examine whether two computation channels share an erroneous requirement, distinguishing design diversity from simply duplicating hardware.
latency_sum|狀態採樣與採用次序~State sampling and adoption order|本單元把輸入讀取、邏輯週期與輸出採用的事件排序，尋找舊新狀態混用的時間窗口。~Order input reading, logic cycles and output adoption to identify windows in which old and new states could be mixed.
clock|事件追溯共同時基~Common clock for event traceability|本單元對齊占用與鎖閉事件的測試紀錄，避免由不同時鐘推論錯誤的因果順序。~Align occupancy and locking events in test logs so different clocks cannot produce an incorrect causal ordering.
coverage|轉移條件覆蓋~Coverage of transition conditions|本單元把每條允許與禁止轉移連到具體測試，另列未覆蓋的故障與恢復邊界。~Trace every permitted and prohibited transition to a concrete test, separately listing uncovered fault and recovery boundaries.
count_balance|占用輸入守恆檢查~Conservation checks for occupancy input|本單元用模型輪對進出事件檢查區段占用輸入，保留未知狀態而不由零差值自動推論清空。~Use model-wheelset entry and exit events to check occupancy input, preserving unknown states instead of inferring clearance automatically from a zero count.
availability|安全停機與服務可用~Safe withdrawal and service availability|本單元將故障時保守停止服務的結果與危險輸出分開，避免為提高可用度而忽略安全性質。~Distinguish conservative service withdrawal from a hazardous output during a fault, avoiding loss of safety properties merely to improve availability.
test_time|聯鎖反例重播~Replaying interlocking counterexamples|本單元將找到的反例縮成可重現事件序列，保留初始狀態及每一步輸入以便修正後回歸。~Reduce a discovered counterexample to a reproducible event sequence, retaining initial state and every input for regression after correction.
confidence_zero|聯鎖測試與證明邊界~Boundaries of testing and proof|本單元比較有限次成功測試與所有可達狀態的性質驗證，明示兩者支持的結論並不相同。~Compare finite successful tests with property verification over all reachable states, stating clearly that the two support different conclusions.
''')
C('b373','軌道電路回路分流與可信占用判讀~Track-circuit paths shunting and trustworthy occupancy interpretation','control',r'''
ohm|軌道回路電阻帳~Resistance accounting for the track circuit|本單元用隔離低壓回路比較送端、鋼軌和接收端電壓，先畫完整回流路徑再解釋電流變化。~Use an isolated low-voltage circuit to compare feed, rail and receiver voltages, drawing the complete return path before interpreting current changes.
parallel|輪對分流與漏電~Wheelset shunts and leakage|本單元把輪對支路與道床漏電支路分開，研究不同路徑如何產生相似的接收訊號下降。~Separate the wheelset path from ballast leakage and examine how different paths can produce similar reductions in the received signal.
rc|輸入濾波與延時~Input filtering and delay|本單元以階躍試驗觀察接收端濾波的延遲代價，將短脈衝抑制與真正狀態改變分開。~Use a step test to observe the latency cost of receiver filtering, distinguishing suppression of brief pulses from a genuine state change.
snr|牽引干擾訊雜比~Signal quality under traction interference|本單元比較固定頻寬內的有效訊號和干擾，不以總電壓變大就判斷占用辨識能力改善。~Compare useful signal and interference within a fixed bandwidth rather than assuming that greater total voltage means improved occupancy discrimination.
latency_sum|偵測至聯鎖交接~Detection-to-interlocking handoff|本單元沿回路量測、接收判定和聯鎖採用追蹤時間，檢查介面等待是否被各自量測漏掉。~Trace timing from circuit measurement through receiver decision to interlocking use, checking for interface waits omitted by separate measurements.
clock|占用事件時間校核~Checking occupancy-event timing|本單元將實際模型輪對通過與接收輸出放在同一時基，分開時鐘偏差及接收反應時間。~Place model-wheelset passage and receiver output on one timebase, separating clock offset from receiver response time.
fault_union|斷線與供電異常辨識~Distinguishing disconnection and supply faults|本單元把可能造成訊號消失的回路斷線與供電異常列成失效樹，要求可區分原因的觀測。~Build a fault tree for circuit disconnection and supply problems that can both remove a signal, requiring observations that distinguish the causes.
redundancy|接收鏈共同原因~Common causes in receiving chains|本單元檢查重複接收器是否共用軌道輸入與電源，說明雙設備無法自行消除輸入共同失效。~Check whether duplicated receivers share the track input and power supply, explaining why duplication cannot remove a common input failure by itself.
coverage|乾濕與故障情境矩陣~Dry wet and fault test matrix|本單元以教具建立乾濕漏電、接觸變化與干擾案例，明列哪些狀態仍未取得測試證據。~Build teaching-rig cases for dry/wet leakage, contact changes and interference, explicitly listing states for which test evidence is still absent.
availability|誤占用維修履歷~Maintenance history of false occupancy|本單元分開保守占用顯示與真正設備失效紀錄，將重複報修合併到同一根因而保留服務影響。~Separate conservative occupied indications from equipment-failure records, linking repeated reports to one cause while retaining their service impact.
''')
C('b374','計軸事件守恆方向與資料有效性~Axle-count event conservation direction and data validity','control',r'''
count_balance|區段軸數守恆~Axle conservation within a section|本單元用標記輪對雙向進出模型區段，核對流入流出與實際區內存量而不連接現場設備。~Move marked model wheelsets through a section in both directions and compare entry, exit and actual occupancy without connecting to field equipment.
pulse_speed|雙感測點方向判別~Direction from paired sensing points|本單元利用同一輪對通過兩個感測點的先後順序，特別檢查低速回滾時的事件配對。~Use the order in which one wheelset passes two sensing points, paying particular attention to event pairing during slow rollback.
sampling|輪脈衝時間解析度~Temporal resolution of wheel pulses|本單元比較不同通過速度的脈衝寬度與取樣間隔，判斷資料列數是否足以保留事件邊界。~Compare pulse width and sampling interval at different passage speeds, assessing whether the samples preserve the event boundaries.
snr|輪感測訊號品質~Wheel-sensor signal quality|本單元將金屬輪對訊號與外部干擾分開量測，使用相同頻寬比較訊雜比而不設定現場門檻。~Measure wheel-related signal and external interference separately, comparing signal quality at equal bandwidth without prescribing field thresholds.
clock|計軸事件排序~Ordering axle-count events|本單元追蹤分散感測點的時間偏差，檢查資料延後抵達時是否仍能保留原始事件順序。~Track clock offsets among distributed sensing points, checking whether original event order survives delayed message arrival.
packet_loss|計數訊息遺失分析~Loss of count-event messages|本單元區分事件沒有產生與事件產生後傳送遺失，透過源端紀錄和接收端紀錄交叉比對。~Distinguish an event that was never generated from one lost after generation by comparing source-side and receiver-side records.
state_space|未知占用狀態保存~Preserving unknown occupancy states|本單元把計數值和有效旗標分開建模，當資料不完整時保留未知而不默認區段清空。~Model count values separately from validity flags, retaining an unknown state when data is incomplete rather than defaulting to a clear section.
redundancy|計軸感測共同原因~Common causes in axle sensing|本單元檢查兩個感測通道是否受同一安裝位移或電磁環境影響，避免把相關輸入當獨立證據。~Examine whether two sensing channels share installation movement or electromagnetic exposure, avoiding treatment of correlated inputs as independent evidence.
coverage|回滾與拆編情境~Rollback and consist-change scenarios|本單元用離線事件序列覆蓋停住、反向與車組改變，逐項核對需求而不提供營運重置程序。~Use offline event sequences for stopping, reversal and consist changes, checking requirements without providing an operational reset procedure.
confidence_zero|漏計試驗統計界限~Statistical bounds for missed counts|本單元將輪對測試紀錄按速度與輪型分層，說明單一條件下零漏計不能證明所有條件無誤。~Stratify wheelset trials by speed and wheel type, explaining why zero missed counts in one condition cannot establish error-free behaviour everywhere.
''')
C('b375','轉轍傳力鎖閉與狀態確認鏈~Point-machine force transfer locking and state-confirmation chain','control',r'''
work|轉轍力位移作功~Point-machine force–travel work|本單元將轉轍機行程分段量測，尋找力位移曲線中局部卡滯而不只比較單一電流峰值。~Measure point-machine travel in segments, seeking localized binding in the force-displacement curve rather than comparing only one current peak.
torque|連桿幾何與力矩~Linkage geometry and torque|本單元畫出馬達到尖軌的傳力路徑，隨連桿角度變化檢查有效力臂與輸出推力。~Draw the force path from motor to switch blade and examine effective lever arm and output force as linkage angle changes.
actuator_sync|雙端行程差異~Travel mismatch between coupled ends|本單元以雙致動教具觀察小速度差如何累積為位置差，將同步需求與機械柔度分開。~Use coupled actuators on a teaching rig to observe small speed differences accumulating into displacement mismatch, separating synchronization from mechanical compliance.
ohm|馬達回路與接觸~Motor circuit and contact behaviour|本單元用隔離直流回路分析接點電阻與供電下降，避免將低電流直接解讀為機械負載低。~Use an isolated DC circuit to examine contact resistance and supply drop, avoiding interpretation of low current as necessarily low mechanical load.
heat|等效持續發熱估算~Equivalent sustained heating estimate|本單元把頻繁轉換的週期平均發熱視為等效持續功率，僅估穩態溫度並檢查外殼量測是否漏掉內部熱點。~Treat duty-averaged heat from repeated movements as equivalent sustained power, estimating steady temperature only and checking whether enclosure measurements miss an internal hotspot.
wear|傳動磨耗履歷~Transmission-wear history|本單元追蹤連接銷與齒輪間隙隨動作次數的變化，避免把短期磨合率當成全壽命磨耗率。~Track pin and gear clearance with movement count rather than treating short running-in wear as a lifetime wear rate.
state_space|鎖閉確認狀態機~State machine for lock confirmation|本單元將行程完成、鎖閉與位置確認分成獨立條件，檢查任何單一訊號是否被錯當全部成立。~Separate completed travel, locking and position confirmation, checking whether any one signal is incorrectly treated as proof of all conditions.
latency_sum|動作與回授時間鏈~Motion and feedback timing chain|本單元比較命令、馬達啟動、行程結束與回授採用時刻，辨認機械延遲及介面延遲。~Compare command, motor start, end of travel and feedback adoption to distinguish mechanical delay from interface delay.
coverage|障礙與中止試驗矩陣~Obstruction and interruption test matrix|本單元只在隔離教具重播障礙與失電情境，確認測試覆蓋並保留安全中止後的狀態證據。~Replay obstruction and power-loss cases only on an isolated teaching rig, checking coverage and preserving state evidence after safe interruption.
availability|轉轍維修服務影響~Service impact of point maintenance|本單元將故障頻率與修復等待分開，辨認備品、定位診斷或機械調整何者主導不可用時間。~Separate failure frequency from repair waiting to identify whether spares, diagnosis or mechanical adjustment dominates unavailable time.
''')
C('b376','多感測定位的誤差相關性與完整性~Error correlation and integrity in multisensor train localization','control',r'''
odometry|輪徑比例與里程~Wheel-scale error and odometry|本單元以長短兩段已知路程分離比例誤差與固定偏移，避免單點校正掩蓋長距離漂移。~Use short and long known distances to separate scale error from fixed offset, preventing a single calibration point from concealing long-distance drift.
pulse_speed|局部通過速度觀測~Local passage-speed observations|本單元以雙感測點估計局部速度，討論事件配對錯誤如何在里程積分中變成位置跳變。~Estimate local speed with paired sensing points and examine how event-pairing errors become position jumps when integrated into odometry.
fusion|獨立觀測加權融合~Weighted fusion of independent observations|本單元比較輪速與外部定位的權重，只有在獨立無偏假設有證據時才採用倒變異數加權。~Compare weights for wheel-based and external position observations, using inverse-variance fusion only when independence and lack of bias are justified.
rss|定位不確定度合成~Combining localization uncertainty|本單元區分隨機標準差、最大界限與共同偏差，避免以平方和開根號縮小所有誤差。~Distinguish random standard deviation, maximum bounds and common bias rather than reducing every error through root-sum-square combination.
position_latency|延遲定位外推~Extrapolating delayed positions|本單元保留量測原始時間並估算資料變舊期間的前進距離，檢查高速時的誤差放大。~Preserve the original measurement time and estimate travel while the observation ages, examining error growth at higher speed.
sampling|速度取樣與空間間距~Speed sampling and spatial intervals|本單元將固定時間取樣轉為里程間隔，辨認高速通過短地標時可能漏失的事件。~Convert fixed-time samples into distance spacing and identify events that may be missed when passing a short landmark at high speed.
clock|融合感測時基漂移~Clock drift in sensor fusion|本單元比較各感測器時鐘的頻率偏差，解釋為何一致的座標仍可能因不同時間而無法融合。~Compare frequency offsets of sensor clocks, explaining why consistent coordinates may still be incompatible when they describe different times.
count_balance|區段占用作粗定位~Section occupancy as coarse location|本單元把計軸區段占用當作粗範圍約束，明確指出它不能直接提供連續車頭位置。~Use axle-count section occupancy as a coarse range constraint, explicitly showing why it cannot directly provide continuous train-front position.
latency_sum|定位處理管線~Localization processing pipeline|本單元追蹤感測、濾波、地圖比對與輸出更新的時間，防止漂亮的定位誤差掩蓋過時結果。~Trace sensing, filtering, map matching and output-update timing so an attractive position-error statistic cannot conceal stale results.
coverage|失訊與錯圖案例~Signal-loss and map-error cases|本單元建立隧道失訊、地圖偏移與輪滑的離線案例，要求融合結果能顯示不確定度而非假精準。~Build offline cases for signal loss, map offset and wheel slip, requiring uncertainty to remain visible rather than reporting false precision.
''')
C('b377','資源占用與延誤傳播的時刻衝突消解~Timetable conflict resolution through resource occupation and delay propagation','control',r'''
headway|區間占用時間~Open-line occupation time|本單元先將車長與防護間隔轉成時間，再比較不同區間的占用以找出最限制排程的資源。~Convert train length and protected spacing into time before comparing section occupations to identify the resource most restrictive to scheduling.
timetable_slack|交會緩衝分配~Allocating crossing buffers|本單元為單線交會配置獨立餘裕，檢查一列車晚到時另一列車的等待如何向後傳播。~Assign distinct margins to a single-track meet and examine how one late arrival propagates waiting to the opposing train.
dwell|停站變異傳播~Propagation of dwell variability|本單元把旅客登車波動轉成停站時間變化，檢查月台服務是否比區間運轉更先控制容量。~Convert boarding variation into dwell-time change and test whether platform service constrains capacity before open-line running does.
utilization|折返資源利用率~Utilization of reversal resources|本單元將折返股道視為有限服務通道，檢查平均需求、尖峰到達與設備中斷的差異。~Treat reversal tracks as finite service channels and distinguish mean demand, peak arrivals and equipment interruptions.
queue|月台旅客積壓~Passenger accumulation at platforms|本單元追蹤列車延誤期間旅客流入與離開，將月台存量納入調度代價而不只最小化列車晚點。~Track passenger arrivals and departures during a train delay, including platform occupancy in dispatch costs rather than minimizing train lateness alone.
clock|實績時刻對齊~Aligning recorded operating times|本單元核對車站與列車記錄的時基，避免把系統時間偏差當作需要調整的時刻衝突。~Check clocks in station and train records so timebase offset is not misidentified as a timetable conflict requiring intervention.
state_space|衝突優先權狀態~Conflict-priority states|本單元列舉讓行、等待與資源保留的抽象狀態，檢查局部決策是否形成循環等待。~Enumerate abstract yield, wait and reservation states to check whether local decisions create a circular wait.
coverage|擾動情境覆蓋~Coverage of disruption scenarios|本單元把單點晚到、多點晚到與折返失效分開測試，避免以正常日重播代表所有調度情境。~Test isolated delay, multiple delays and failed reversal separately rather than treating normal-day replay as representative of every dispatch scenario.
test_time|時刻重播工作量~Timetable-replay effort|本單元規畫多個需求水準與擾動組合的重播，保留初始列車位置和旅客需求以利比較。~Plan replay over demand levels and disruption combinations, retaining initial train positions and passenger demand for meaningful comparison.
confidence_zero|穩健時刻證據限制~Evidence limits for robust timetables|本單元檢查零衝突模擬是否來自有限擾動集合，將可行性結論限制在已驗證的假設範圍。~Examine whether conflict-free simulations cover only a limited disruption set, bounding feasibility claims by the assumptions actually tested.
''')
C('b378','行控資訊層次警報與人員判讀~Control-centre information hierarchy alarms and human interpretation','control',r'''
alarm_rate|警報負荷與重複~Alarm loading and duplication|本單元把同一根因連帶警報與獨立事件分群，檢查關鍵資訊是否被大量確認操作掩蓋。~Group cascade alarms from one cause separately from independent events and check whether repeated acknowledgements obscure the essential information.
reaction_distance|察覺與動作延遲~Detection and action delay|本單元在安全桌面情境量測訊息出現到正確處置的時間，區分看見、理解與動作三個階段，再換算同期間列車前進距離。~Measure message-to-correct-action time in a safe desktop scenario, distinguishing seeing, understanding and acting, then convert that delay into distance travelled by the moving train.
clock|事件時間線一致性~Consistency of event timelines|本單元對照各設備日誌的時鐘偏移，防止畫面上的先後排序讓操作員建立錯誤因果故事。~Compare clock offsets in equipment logs so display ordering does not lead operators to construct an incorrect causal explanation.
position_latency|畫面位置資料年齡~Age of displayed position data|本單元讓位置圖示同時顯示資料年齡，辨認流暢動畫與可信即時資訊並不是同一件事。~Display data age alongside the position symbol, distinguishing a smooth animation from trustworthy current information.
throughput|畫面更新訊息流~Message flow for display updates|本單元比較更新頻率、列車數及訊息大小，評估資料量增加時畫面是否出現排隊與跳動。~Compare update frequency, train count and message size, examining queueing and display jumps as data demand increases.
state_space|命令確認與模式~Command confirmation and modes|本單元把已選取、已送出、已接受與已完成分成不同狀態，避免按鈕變色被誤認為設備動作完成。~Separate selected, sent, accepted and completed states so a button colour change cannot be mistaken for completed equipment action.
illuminance|顯示可讀性環境~Viewing environment and legibility|本單元以照度教具比較暗點與眩光，將環境亮度與資訊對比分開而不只檢查螢幕亮起。~Use a lighting rig to compare dark areas and glare, separating ambient illumination from information contrast rather than merely checking that a screen is on.
coverage|異常介面任務矩陣~Abnormal-interface task matrix|本單元把不同角色的判讀與確認任務連到測試案例，保留錯誤與近失誤以改善資訊設計。~Trace interpretation and confirmation tasks for different roles to test cases, retaining errors and near misses to improve information design.
test_time|人因重播與交接~Human-factors replay and handover|本單元安排情境重播與值班交接演練，將說明時間、休息和狀態復原納入工時估算。~Plan scenario replays and shift-handover exercises, including briefing, rest and state restoration in effort estimates.
confidence_zero|少量受試結果外推~Extrapolating limited user trials|本單元檢查受試者是否只來自熟悉系統的人員，避免零錯誤結果被外推到所有能力與情境。~Check whether participants are limited to experienced users and avoid extending zero-error results to every capability and scenario.
''')
C('b379','號誌危害邏輯共同原因與證據鏈~Signalling hazard logic common causes and evidence chains','control',r'''
fault_union|頂事件邏輯選擇~Selecting top-event logic|本單元先辨認任一失效與同時失效的差別，再以原創機率練習檢查失效樹的邏輯。~Distinguish either-failure from simultaneous-failure conditions before using original probability exercises to check fault-tree logic.
redundancy|共同原因殘餘風險~Residual common-cause risk|本單元將共享電源、環境與需求錯誤列入雙通道分析，觀察獨立故障降低後何者成為主導。~Include shared power, environment and requirement errors in a dual-channel analysis, observing what dominates after independent failures are reduced.
availability|安全性與可用度分離~Separating safety and availability|本單元比較安全停止與危險繼續輸出兩種後果，避免以服務持續時間推論危害發生機率。~Compare safe withdrawal with hazardous continued output, avoiding inference of hazard probability from service uptime.
state_space|安全性質的狀態域~State domain of safety properties|本單元定義性質需涵蓋的可達狀態，特別保留故障與恢復而不只列正常運轉。~Define the reachable states over which a property must hold, retaining fault and recovery states rather than only normal operation.
latency_sum|偵測與安全反應時間~Detection and safe-response timing|本單元串接異常感測、判定與安全反應時間，清楚標示各段假設與未建模的致動延遲。~Link anomaly sensing, decision and safe response timing, explicitly marking assumptions and actuator delays not represented by a model.
packet_loss|故障資訊可靠傳遞~Reliable transfer of fault information|本單元比較獨立丟包與共同失聯對故障通報的影響，將訊息可靠送達與仍然及時分開。~Compare independent losses and common outages in fault reporting, separating eventual delivery from delivery while the information remains timely.
coverage|危害需求追溯~Tracing hazards to requirements|本單元建立危害、控制措施、需求與試驗的連結，將缺少證據的項目明列而不以總百分比掩蓋。~Link hazards, controls, requirements and tests, listing missing evidence explicitly rather than concealing it inside an overall percentage.
confidence_zero|零失效證據解讀~Interpreting zero-failure evidence|本單元從有限試驗推導單側機率上界，說明不能以零失敗取代系統性故障的設計論證。~Derive a one-sided probability bound from finite trials and explain why zero failures cannot replace arguments about systematic design faults.
clock|故障時間窗一致性~Consistent fault time windows|本單元核對失效事件與任務期間的定義，避免把不同時間窗的紀錄直接放進同一風險模型。~Check definitions of failure events and mission duration, avoiding combination of records from different time windows in one risk model.
test_time|變更後證據重建~Rebuilding evidence after change|本單元分析設計變更影響哪些需求和試驗，將需重新取得的證據與可沿用證據分開。~Analyse which requirements and tests a design change affects, separating evidence that must be regenerated from evidence that remains applicable.
''')
C('b380','平交道警示時序道路清空與界面整合~Crossing-warning timing road clearance and interface integration','crossing',r'''
reaction_distance|道路使用者反應距離~Road-user reaction distance|本單元以假想道路接近速度分析察覺到反應的移動距離，保留不同視線與能力群體的差異。~Use an assumed road-approach speed to analyse travel between detection and response, retaining differences in visibility and user capability.
braking|道路車輛停止距離~Stopping distance of road vehicles|本單元將道路車輛反應距離與制動距離分開計算，強調此練習不是實際平交道設計視距。~Calculate reaction and braking distances separately for a road vehicle, emphasizing that the exercise is not an actual crossing sight-distance design.
vehicle_clearance|車輛清空所需時間~Time required for vehicle clearance|本單元以低速穿越距離和等待觀察清空時間，分開長車尾端離開與車頭通過的時刻。~Use low-speed crossing distance and waiting to study clearance time, distinguishing the rear leaving the conflict area from the front merely passing through.
vehicle_queue|路口回堵累積~Queue spillback toward the crossing|本單元直接追蹤鄰近路口車輛到達與離開率，說明下游服務不足如何造成車數累積，並將車列長度另列為幾何限制。~Track vehicle arrival and departure rates directly at the adjacent junction, showing how insufficient downstream service accumulates vehicles while treating physical queue length as a separate geometric constraint.
latency_sum|警示聯動時序~Timing of coordinated warnings|本單元將列車接近偵測、介面傳遞與道路警示動作分段記錄，避免漏掉交接時間。~Record train-approach detection, interface transfer and road-warning action as separate stages, avoiding omitted handoff time.
clock|道路與鐵道事件對齊~Aligning road and rail events|本單元核對道路控制器與鐵道紀錄的時基，讓事件重建能可靠區分先因後果。~Check road-controller and railway-log timebases so event reconstruction can distinguish cause and consequence reliably.
count_balance|區段偵測有效性~Validity of section detection|本單元以離線計數模型檢查接近區段的占用資訊，保留感測故障與未知狀態。~Use an offline counting model to check approach-section occupancy information while retaining sensor-failure and unknown states.
battery|警示備援電源~Backup energy for warnings|本單元估算警示設備斷電後的能量需求，另檢查閃光器與致動器啟動時的電壓下降。~Estimate energy demand after warning-system supply loss and separately check voltage sag during lamp and actuator startup.
fault_union|警示失效原因樹~Fault causes for warning failure|本單元將供電、通訊和顯示器異常分開列入原因樹，要求每個候選原因有可區分的量測。~Separate supply, communication and display faults in a cause tree, requiring discriminating measurements for each candidate cause.
coverage|路鐵整合情境矩陣~Road–rail integration scenario matrix|本單元以桌面重播檢查長車、回堵、失電和資訊延遲，完整保留測試條件與未涵蓋限制。~Use desktop replay for long vehicles, spillback, power loss and delayed information, preserving conditions and limits not covered by the test set.
''')
C('b381','停車位置門控時序與月台介面誤差預算~Stopping position door timing and platform-interface error budgets','station',r'''
braking|停準接近軌跡~Precision-stop approach trajectory|本單元將車門對位誤差追溯到進站速度與制動建立時間，分開縱向停準與橫向月台間隙。~Trace door-alignment errors to approach speed and brake build-up, distinguishing longitudinal stopping accuracy from the lateral platform gap.
position_latency|停準資訊有效時間~Freshness of stopping information|本單元比較最後定位點到開門判定的資料年齡，理解車速接近零仍不代表資料來源已被確認。~Compare data age between the final position observation and the door decision; near-zero speed does not establish that the position source has been validated.
gap_budget|車門月台橫向容差~Lateral door–platform tolerances|本單元列出軌道偏移、車體側移與量測基準的界限，避免把縱向停準良好誤當全部幾何介面良好。~List bounds for track offset, body movement and survey references, avoiding the assumption that good longitudinal stopping establishes every geometric interface.
rss|重複停準統計分散~Statistical spread of repeated stops|本單元將平均停車偏移與隨機分散分開，只有獨立誤差才能以變異數相加而不隱藏共同基準偏差。~Separate mean stopping offset from random spread, adding variances only for independent errors without concealing a shared reference bias.
latency_sum|列車與月台門交接~Train and platform-door handoff|本單元記錄停穩、位置確認、門控接收與動作回授的順序，找出跨設備等待而非只看單門動作時間。~Record stopped state, position confirmation, command reception and movement feedback to identify inter-device waiting rather than only individual door travel time.
state_space|門組配對狀態機~Paired-door state machine|本單元在離線模型區分車門、月台門、停準與障礙狀態，檢查配對錯誤是否可能被單一正常旗標掩蓋。~Separate train doors, platform doors, alignment and obstruction in an offline model, checking whether one normal flag can conceal a pairing error.
dwell|旅客交換與門週期~Passenger exchange and door cycle|本單元把旅客交換時間與關門確認時間分開，分析窄門、行李及重複開門如何改變站停變異。~Separate passenger exchange from closure confirmation and examine how narrow openings, luggage and repeated opening change dwell variability.
availability|門組故障服務影響~Service impact of door faults|本單元比較單門停用與整列無法服務的影響，將修復等待和元件更換時間分開記錄。~Compare loss of one doorway with loss of an entire train service, recording repair waiting separately from component replacement time.
coverage|異車型門位配對~Door-position mapping across fleets|本單元建立車型、編組方向與停車標記的案例矩陣，將尚未測過的門位組合明列為證據缺口。~Build a matrix of fleet type, formation direction and stopping marker, explicitly listing untested door-position combinations as evidence gaps.
confidence_zero|停準試驗樣本界限~Sampling limits of stopping trials|本單元檢查重複停車試驗是否涵蓋載重和不同黏著，避免同一乾燥條件的成功次數取代情境多樣性。~Check whether repeated stopping trials cover load and adhesion differences rather than substituting many successes under one dry condition for scenario diversity.
''')
C('b382','旅客守恆局部密度與離散事件模擬~Passenger conservation local density and discrete-event simulation','station',r'''
queue|尖峰到達累積~Accumulation under peak arrivals|本單元從列車到站帶來的需求波開始記錄，將進出站人數與區內存量放在相同時間窗。~Start with the demand wave created by a train arrival, measuring entries, exits and internal occupancy over the same time window.
little|平均停留與存量~Mean residence and occupancy|本單元比較大廳平均人數與旅客停留時間，檢查觀察時段是否仍在累積而不符合穩態解讀。~Compare mean concourse occupancy with passenger residence time, checking whether the observation period is still accumulating and therefore unsuitable for steady-state interpretation.
flow_width|閘門後共同瓶頸~Shared bottlenecks beyond gates|本單元將多個閘門與共同出口連成服務網路，避免把各設備銘牌通量直接相加成全站容量。~Connect multiple gates to their shared exit as a service network instead of adding individual nameplate flows into a station-wide capacity.
density|局部群聚網格~Spatial cells for local clustering|本單元在樓梯口與月台門前建立小網格，對照全站平均與局部峰值以辨認模型空間解析度需求。~Create small spatial cells at stairs and platform doors, comparing global means with local peaks to determine required model resolution.
travel|轉乘路徑與等待~Transfer paths and waiting|本單元把步行段、辨識方向與排隊段分開，檢查最短距離路徑是否也是不同能力群體的最短時間。~Separate walking, wayfinding and queuing to test whether the shortest-distance route also gives the shortest time for different user capabilities.
dwell|月台交換耦合~Coupling platform exchange to dwell|本單元將上車需求回饋到列車停站時間，再讓停站變化影響後續到達波，形成可觀察的閉迴路。~Feed boarding demand into train dwell and then let dwell variation affect subsequent arrival waves, creating an observable feedback loop.
evacuation|非常態需求與出口~Exceptional demand and exits|本單元用原創串行算例比較出口不可用情境，將正常營運客流校準與火災生命安全論證分開。~Use an original serial example to compare unavailable exits, separating normal-service flow calibration from a fire life-safety argument.
pedestrian_sampling|人流資料取樣尺度~Sampling scale for flow data|本單元用低密度步行軌跡的固定時間取樣建立空間間距，檢查時間步長是否漏掉短暫停頓與交會。~Use fixed-time observations of low-density walking trajectories to calculate spatial spacing, checking whether the time step misses brief pauses or interactions.
coverage|需求群體情境矩陣~Population and demand scenario matrix|本單元分別測試攜帶行李、協助需求與單向尖峰，保留未校準的群體而不以平均旅客取代所有人。~Test luggage, assistance needs and directional peaks separately, retaining uncalibrated populations rather than replacing everyone with an average traveller.
confidence_zero|模擬成功外推界限~Limits of successful simulation runs|本單元檢查無壅塞結果是否依賴相同隨機種子及固定需求，將可重現性與獨立抽樣明確區分。~Check whether congestion-free results depend on one random seed and fixed demand, distinguishing reproducibility from independent sampling.
''')
C('b383','轉乘樓層高差通道分流與等候整合~Transfer-level changes route splitting and waiting integration','station',r'''
flow_width|樓梯出口有效淨寬~Effective width at stair exits|本單元辨認樓梯、扶手與下游門口的最窄斷面，檢查雙向人流是否共用同一有限寬度。~Locate the narrowest section among stairs, handrails and downstream doors, checking whether opposing flows share the same limited width.
travel|跨樓層轉乘時間~Travel time between levels|本單元將長距離步行與電梯等待分開記錄，對照不同轉乘路線的可達性和到達時間分布。~Record long walking segments separately from elevator waits, comparing accessibility and arrival-time distributions across transfer routes.
slope|高差與坡道路徑~Level changes and ramp routes|本單元用端點高程與水平距離檢查坡道幾何，另外保留平台、轉向空間與排水造成的局部橫坡。~Check ramp geometry using endpoint elevations and horizontal run, while separately retaining landings, turning space and drainage-related local cross-slope.
queue|扶梯下端積壓~Accumulation at escalator landings|本單元追蹤下游突然降速造成的等候存量，避免只用扶梯運轉速度推論落地區可以承受人流。~Track waiting occupancy when downstream movement slows, avoiding inference of landing capacity from escalator running speed alone.
little|電梯等候平均存量~Mean occupancy in elevator waiting|本單元以共同入口邊界核對平均等待與排隊人數，將乘車時間和候梯時間分開避免重複計入。~Use one entrance boundary to compare average wait with queue size, separating travel inside the lift from waiting to avoid double counting.
density|轉角匯流局部密度~Local density at merging corners|本單元觀察轉角、立柱與路徑交叉形成的群聚，對照同面積卻不同幾何配置的密度分布。~Observe clustering at corners, columns and crossing paths, comparing density distributions for equal areas with different geometry.
elevator_cycle|垂直運輸往返節拍~Round-trip vertical-service cycle|本單元把電梯登乘、行進、離開及回程直接列成完整週期，將門動作納入服務時間並區分每小時循環與每小時旅客數。~List elevator boarding, travel, alighting and return directly as one complete cycle, including door actions and distinguishing trips per hour from passengers per hour.
illuminance|層間辨識與照明~Level identification and lighting|本單元檢查轉折處照度與指標對比，讓旅客能在到達分流點前辨認正確樓層與方向。~Check illuminance and sign contrast at turns so travellers can identify the correct level and direction before reaching the route split.
coverage|電梯停用替代路徑~Alternative routes during lift outages|本單元以角色任務矩陣檢查電梯停用後的可達路徑，不能把需要樓梯的替代線視為所有旅客可用。~Use a user-task matrix to examine accessible routes during a lift outage; a stair-only alternative is not usable by every passenger.
test_time|跨層動線驗證安排~Planning multilevel route verification|本單元安排不同到達波與設備停用組合的重播，保留初始排隊與協助人員配置以便重現結果。~Plan replay across arrival waves and equipment outages, retaining initial queues and assistance staffing so results can be reproduced.
''')
C('b384','月台車輛幾何介面與連續無障礙路徑~Platform–vehicle geometry and continuous accessible journeys','access',r'''
gap_budget|月台與車體界限~Platform and vehicle bounds|本單元將軌道、車體懸吊與測量誤差分開列帳，檢查空車靜態資料對載重狀態是否仍適用。~Account separately for track, body suspension and survey uncertainty, checking whether empty stationary measurements remain applicable under load.
rss|重複量測與共同偏差~Repeated observations and shared bias|本單元用重複讀值估算分散，再用獨立基準辨認共同偏差，避免重複次數增加帶來虛假的信心。~Estimate spread from repeated readings and use an independent reference to identify shared bias, avoiding false confidence from repetition alone.
slope|坡道縱橫坡分離~Separating ramp slope and cross-slope|本單元同時保留長向高差與橫向排水需求，將整段平均坡度與輪椅實際輪跡局部坡度比較。~Retain longitudinal rise and transverse drainage requirements, comparing whole-route average slope with local slope along actual wheelchair paths.
travel|無障礙完整旅程~Complete accessible journey time|本單元從站外入口追蹤至車廂的連續路徑，將電梯等待、開門與協助時間納入相同系統邊界。~Trace a continuous journey from the external entrance to the carriage, including lift waits, doors and assistance within one system boundary.
flow_width|輔具通行有效空間~Clear space for mobility aids|本單元把門扇、立柱與轉彎路徑視為幾何限制，明確區分通道流率算例與個人可通行性。~Treat door leaves, columns and turning paths as geometric constraints, distinguishing a passage-flow calculation from individual passability.
illuminance|視覺辨識與暗點~Visual recognition and dark areas|本單元比較月台邊緣、指標與車門前的照度分布，檢查平均值是否掩蓋弱視旅客需要辨認的暗點。~Compare lighting at platform edges, signs and doors, checking whether an average hides dark areas important to passengers with low vision.
dwell|協助登乘時間~Assisted boarding time|本單元把一般旅客交換與協助登乘分成可重疊或不可重疊工作，避免用平均停站時間壓縮必要協助。~Separate ordinary exchange and assisted boarding into overlapping and non-overlapping tasks, avoiding pressure to compress assistance into an average dwell.
queue|電梯服務需求累積~Accumulating demand for elevators|本單元追蹤行動受限者及攜行李旅客的共同需求，保留無法立即進入下一班電梯的人數。~Track shared demand from mobility-limited and luggage-carrying users, retaining those unable to enter the next lift rather than discarding them.
coverage|使用者能力案例矩陣~User-capability case matrix|本單元以不同輔具、視覺與聽覺需求檢查同一路徑，要求每個介面都有對應的可觀察任務。~Check one route with different mobility, vision and hearing needs, requiring an observable task for each interface.
confidence_zero|使用性測試推論~Inference from usability trials|本單元檢查受試者是否涵蓋真正的能力差異，強調有限次順利通行不能證明所有使用者都無障礙。~Check whether participants represent meaningful capability differences; a finite set of successful trips does not establish access for every user.
''')
C('b385','車站煙流風路與疏散需求的整合~Integrating station smoke paths airflow and egress requirements','station',r'''
ventilation|排煙斷面速度分布~Velocity distribution in exhaust sections|本單元從多點風速還原斷面流量，區分局部高速射流與真正能帶走煙氣的整體流路。~Reconstruct section flow from multiple velocity readings, separating a local fast jet from a complete path capable of transporting smoke.
fan_power|風機壓升能量帳~Fan pressure and energy accounting|本單元將風機壓升、風道損失與輸入功率放在同一工作點，檢查備援設備是否共用阻塞路徑。~Place fan pressure rise, duct loss and input power at one operating point, checking whether redundant equipment shares a blocked path.
orifice|門口與旁通流量~Doorway and bypass flow|本單元以孔口近似比較門開度與壓差，明示此模型無法解析上下反向的分層煙流。~Compare door opening and pressure difference with an orifice approximation, explicitly excluding counterflowing stratified smoke from the model.
pressure|風速量級與壓力~Air-speed scale and pressure|本單元把動壓作為局部量級參考，另量門兩側靜壓以避免將迎風測壓值直接當作門負荷。~Use dynamic pressure as a local scale reference and separately measure static pressure on both sides of a door instead of equating an impact reading with door load.
evacuation|煙流與清空時間邊界~Smoke and clearance-time boundaries|本單元將需求疏散時間分成反應、移動與服務，另列尚未求得的可用安全時間作為缺失輸入。~Separate required egress time into response, movement and service, explicitly listing uncomputed available safe time as missing evidence.
latency_sum|偵測至風路建立~From detection to established airflow|本單元記錄偵測、模式判定、風門動作與氣流建立，避免以電氣啟動回授代替真正風路形成。~Record detection, mode decision, damper travel and airflow establishment, avoiding substitution of electrical start feedback for an established flow path.
battery|控制與照明備援~Backup for controls and lighting|本單元把控制器與指示照明負載獨立列帳，明示小型電池算例不代表整組排煙風機的供電。~Account separately for controls and directional lighting, explicitly noting that this small-battery example does not represent power for the complete smoke-exhaust fan set.
illuminance|低照度疏散辨識~Egress recognition under low lighting|本單元先量無煙環境照度與暗點，再列出煙氣散射尚未涵蓋，避免把照度合格當作能見度合格。~Measure smoke-free illuminance and dark areas first, then list unmodelled smoke scattering rather than treating adequate illuminance as adequate visibility.
fault_union|共用風路失效原因~Fault causes in shared airflow paths|本單元把供電、風門卡滯與流路阻塞分開建樹，要求各原因有不同量測證據而非只看運轉訊號。~Separate supply loss, stuck dampers and path blockage in a cause tree, requiring distinct evidence rather than one common running signal.
coverage|排煙模式整合案例~Integrated smoke-mode cases|本單元在離線模型組合列車位置、門狀態與單設備故障，將未測邊界逐一連到設計需求。~Combine train location, door state and single-equipment faults in an offline model, tracing untested boundaries to design requirements.
''')
C('b386','列車活塞效應旁通開口與壓力瞬變~Train piston effects bypass openings and pressure transients','station',r'''
pressure|列車誘導壓力量級~Scale of train-induced pressure|本單元以局部風速平方比較壓力量級，保留列車阻塞率與波反射尚未求解的差異。~Compare pressure scales using local air-speed squared, retaining the unsolved influence of train blockage and wave reflection.
ventilation|活塞風斷面積分~Section integration of piston airflow|本單元在列車進出站期間量測有正負號的速度，防止正反流動被平均後誤判為持續單向送風。~Measure signed velocity during train entry and departure, preventing reversing flow from being mistaken for sustained one-way ventilation.
orifice|旁通開口壓差流量~Pressure-driven bypass flow|本單元比較旁通面積增加對流量的影響，另外追蹤煙流模式是否因新增連通路徑而改變。~Compare the effect of increased bypass area on flow and separately track whether the added connection changes smoke-control paths.
fan_power|風機與活塞作用疊合~Fans interacting with piston effects|本單元以穩態功率帳作基準，再標記列車通過造成的工作點偏移，避免假設風機流量始終固定。~Use a steady power balance as a reference, then mark operating-point shifts during train passage instead of assuming constant fan flow.
temporal_sampling|壓力峰值取樣解析~Sampling resolution for pressure peaks|本單元由壓力取樣頻率直接計算相鄰時間間隔，檢查感測頻寬、濾波及取樣是否會漏掉門負載的短暫峰值。~Calculate time intervals directly from pressure sampling frequency and examine whether sensor bandwidth, filtering or sampling misses brief door-load peaks.
clock|列車風壓事件同步~Synchronizing train and pressure events|本單元把列車位置、風速與壓力記錄對齊，確保觀察到的先後關係來自流場而不是時鐘漂移。~Align train position, air velocity and pressure logs so observed sequencing reflects the flow field rather than clock drift.
pressure_rss|壓力量測誤差合成~Combining pressure measurement uncertainty|本單元以帕斯卡為單位合成兩個獨立壓力通道的標準差，另列共用參考壓力與校正偏差以避免低估不確定度。~Combine standard deviations of two independent pressure channels in pascals, separately retaining common reference-pressure and calibration biases to avoid understated uncertainty.
latency_sum|風門反應時間鏈~Damper-response timing chain|本單元分開通訊命令、致動器移動和壓力實際變化，避免以風門已收到命令推論壓力已被抑制。~Separate command delivery, actuator movement and actual pressure change; command reception does not establish that the pressure transient has been reduced.
state_space|通風模式相容狀態~Compatibility of ventilation modes|本單元檢查正常舒適通風與緊急煙控的模式交接，列出相互矛盾的風門組合而不提供現場操作順序。~Check handover between comfort ventilation and emergency smoke control, listing contradictory damper states without giving field operating sequences.
coverage|不同列車通過情境~Scenarios for different train passages|本單元分別比較停站、通過與對向列車事件，將車門和旁通開口狀態保留為獨立測試因素。~Compare stopping, through-running and opposing-train events, retaining door and bypass states as independent test factors.
''')
C('b387','隧道步道連續性照明與協助疏散~Tunnel-walkway continuity lighting and assisted evacuation','station',r'''
travel|步道距離與協助時間~Walkway distance and assistance time|本單元把車門至安全出口分段記錄，將步行、跨越介面與等待協助分開而不使用單一最快步速。~Segment the route from carriage door to safe exit, separating walking, interface crossing and assistance waits instead of using one fastest walking speed.
flow_width|步道局部有效淨寬~Local effective walkway width|本單元量測電纜箱、扶手與設備突出物造成的縮口，檢查上游寬步道是否仍受下游窄門控制。~Measure restrictions from cable boxes, handrails and protruding equipment, checking whether a wide upstream walkway remains limited by a narrow downstream door.
slope|高程轉換與橫坡~Elevation changes and cross-slope|本單元比較車門下車處、聯絡通道與出口的高差，另列局部台階及坡道平台的連續性需求。~Compare elevation changes at train exits, cross-passages and final exits, separately retaining local steps and continuity at ramp landings.
evacuation|串行疏散時間帳~Serial accounting of egress time|本單元在原創假想人數下建立時間帳，明列煙氣條件與可用安全時間沒有被此公式求解。~Build a timing account for an original assumed population, explicitly recording that smoke conditions and available safe time are not solved by the formula.
illuminance|步道照度與暗區~Walkway illuminance and dark zones|本單元沿實際行走面布點量測，對照設備遮影與轉彎處的方向辨識而非只查燈具數量。~Measure along the actual walking surface, examining equipment shadows and direction recognition at turns instead of merely counting luminaires.
battery|緊急照明能量~Emergency-lighting energy|本單元以固定照明負載估算續航，再分別檢查啟動壓降與老化，使能量和電壓兩種限制都可見。~Estimate duration at a fixed lighting load, then separately check startup sag and ageing so both energy and voltage limits remain visible.
density|下車匯流區密度~Density in alighting merge areas|本單元將多車門匯入同一步道的區域細分，檢查平均全隧道人數是否掩蓋局部等待群聚。~Subdivide the area where several train exits merge into one walkway, checking whether a tunnel-wide average hides local waiting clusters.
queue|出口服務積壓~Accumulation at exit service points|本單元記錄出口前的到達與通過人數，將不可立即離開的人保留在區內存量以維持守恆。~Record arrivals and passages at the exit, retaining people unable to leave immediately in internal occupancy to preserve conservation.
coverage|協助需求路徑案例~Route cases for assistance needs|本單元以不同視覺、行動及溝通需求檢查路徑，將協助裝備與人員抵達時間列入情境。~Check routes for different vision, mobility and communication needs, including arrival times for assistance equipment and staff.
test_time|受控演練證據安排~Evidence planning for controlled exercises|本單元安排無擁擠的分段演練，保留場景初始狀態和觀察點，讓後續修正能使用相同證據比較。~Plan non-crowding segmented exercises, preserving initial conditions and observation points so later modifications can be compared using consistent evidence.
''')
C('b388','機廠資源配置檢修節拍與安全動線~Depot resources maintenance cycles and safe movement paths','depot' if False else 'machinery',r'''
utilization|檢修工位利用率~Utilization of maintenance bays|本單元將車輛到達需求和可用工位分開，檢查平均利用率相同時尖峰排隊仍可能完全不同。~Separate vehicle arrival demand from available bays, checking why identical mean utilization can still produce very different peak queues.
depot_cycle|車輛移交完整週期~Complete vehicle-handoff cycle|本單元把接車、檢查、移動與交回的工作分段，將完整節拍直接對應檢修物流並保留驗證交回時間。~Break receiving, inspection, movement and return into stages, mapping the complete cycle directly to depot logistics and retaining verified handoff time.
travel|人員與備料路徑~Staff and material-preparation routes|本單元量測人員往返備品區的步行與等待，檢查縮短距離是否造成車輛動線交叉與額外停頓。~Measure staff walking and waiting to reach spares, checking whether a shorter route creates vehicle-path crossings and additional pauses.
state_space|車輛工位狀態管理~Vehicle and bay state management|本單元分開待檢、作業中、驗證與可交車狀態，避免工具收回就被誤認為所有維修證據已完成。~Separate awaiting inspection, work in progress, verification and release readiness; removal of tools does not establish completion of maintenance evidence.
coverage|檢修需求追溯~Tracing maintenance requirements|本單元將缺陷、工項和驗證紀錄連到同一車輛識別，檢查重複工單是否掩蓋未完成需求。~Link defect, work item and verification record to one vehicle identity, checking whether duplicate work orders conceal incomplete requirements.
availability|設備停機與備品等待~Equipment outages and spares waiting|本單元分開機具修復和等待備品的時間，讓維修排程能辨認真正造成工位停用的因素。~Separate repair time from waiting for spares so maintenance planning can identify what actually keeps a bay unavailable.
illuminance|檢查面照明分布~Lighting on inspection surfaces|本單元比較車底陰影與一般作業面照度，檢查局部視線受阻是否使平均明亮的工位仍難以辨認缺陷。~Compare underbody shadows with normal work-surface lighting, checking whether local obstruction makes defects hard to recognize despite a bright bay average.
latency_sum|工單與實體狀態交接~Handoff of work orders and physical state|本單元對齊電子工單更新與實體車輛移交的時間，防止資料已完成但現場尚未完成的版本落差。~Align electronic work-order updates with physical vehicle handoff, preventing a completed database entry from concealing unfinished physical work.
test_time|檢修驗證工時計畫~Planning maintenance verification effort|本單元將檢查、重置、證據保存及缺陷重測納入完整時間，不把計畫工時只等同於首次操作時間。~Include inspection, reset, evidence preservation and defect reruns in effort estimates rather than equating planned duration with first-pass operation alone.
confidence_zero|維修品質抽樣推論~Sampling inference for maintenance quality|本單元比較少數重複車型與多樣車況的抽樣，將零返修紀錄的結論限制於實際觀察族群。~Compare repeated sampling of one fleet type with varied vehicle conditions, bounding zero-return claims by the population actually observed.
''')
C('b389','轉向架更換的載重分配同步與定位~Load sharing synchronization and positioning in bogie exchange','machinery',r'''
lifting|車體承載點平均反力~Mean reactions at body supports|本單元先用假想車體重量估算平均反力，再強調實際重心與支承剛度必須另有量測證據。~First estimate mean reaction from an assumed body weight, then emphasize that actual centre of gravity and support stiffness require separate evidence.
eccentric|偏心載重重新分配~Redistribution under eccentric loading|本單元比較車內設備偏置造成的左右反力，核對總和相同但單點載重可能增加的情況。~Compare left and right reactions caused by offset onboard equipment, checking how one support can gain load while the total remains unchanged.
hydraulic|液壓推力與保持~Hydraulic force and holding|本單元以隔離縮尺台核對壓力與力，另觀察停留漂移並說明壓力表不等於機械保持證據。~Compare pressure and force on an isolated scale rig, separately observing holding drift and explaining why a pressure gauge is not evidence of mechanical retention.
sync_error|多點吊升高度差~Height mismatch during multipoint lifting|本單元同步量測四個支承的高程，辨認位置差是原始零點偏移還是動作期間逐漸累積。~Measure elevations at four supports simultaneously, distinguishing an initial reference offset from mismatch accumulated during movement.
survey_angle|轉向架定位基準~Reference geometry for bogie positioning|本單元用小角度誤差估算定位點的橫向偏移，將地坪基準和車體基準分開核對。~Estimate transverse positioning error from a small angular error, checking floor references separately from body references.
rss|定位量測不確定度~Uncertainty of positioning measurements|本單元將重複量測分散與共同基準偏差分離，避免均方根合成讓固定定位偏差被縮小。~Separate repeated-measurement spread from shared datum bias, avoiding a root-sum-square calculation that artificially reduces fixed positioning error.
heat|升降設備穩態散熱~Steady cooling of lifting equipment|本單元用等效持續功率估算液壓站或馬達穩態溫度，明確保留短時升降熱峰未被模型涵蓋。~Use equivalent sustained power to estimate steady hydraulic-unit or motor temperature, explicitly retaining short lifting heat peaks outside the model.
wear|接觸與導向磨耗~Wear in contact and guidance parts|本單元追蹤導向輪與承載接點間隙，檢查磨耗率是否因偏載而改變並影響定位重複性。~Track clearance at guide rollers and support contacts, checking whether eccentric loading changes wear rate and positioning repeatability.
state_space|交換作業互鎖狀態~Interlocked states of exchange work|本單元只在離線模型區分承載、移動與定位條件，檢查任何動作是否依賴尚未確認的支承狀態。~Distinguish support, motion and alignment conditions only in an offline model, checking whether a movement depends on an unconfirmed support state.
test_time|設備驗證與證據重播~Equipment verification and evidence replay|本單元規畫空載與縮尺偏載試驗的證據保存，將初始支承設定和感測器校正一併納入重播條件。~Plan evidence preservation for unloaded and scale eccentric-load tests, including initial support setup and sensor calibration in replay conditions.
''')
C('b390','輪對在軌加工的幾何材料去除與量測~Geometry material removal and measurement in underfloor wheel machining','machinery',r'''
cut_speed|輪徑與切削線速度~Wheel diameter and cutting speed|本單元比較磨耗前後輪徑對接觸線速度的影響，分開驅動滾輪轉速與真正輪對轉速。~Compare contact-speed changes before and after diameter wear, separating drive-roller speed from actual wheelset rotation.
diameter_loss|徑向去除與壽命帳~Radial removal and life accounting|本單元把單側切深換算成直徑耗用，將每次修整量保留在輪對履歷以檢查剩餘材料。~Convert radial cut depth to diameter consumption, retaining each reprofiling removal in wheelset history to track remaining material.
material_rate|切屑體積與節拍~Chip volume and processing cycle|本單元以矩形切屑類比計算去除率，另外計入檢測與重工時間以免只追求刀具接觸時間最短。~Use a rectangular-chip analogy to estimate removal rate and separately include inspection and rework rather than minimizing tool-contact time alone.
heat|加工設備穩態熱路~Steady heat paths in machining equipment|本單元以等效持續熱源觀察冷卻路徑，區分機體穩態溫升與刀尖短時高溫不能由同一模型代表。~Observe cooling paths under equivalent sustained heating, distinguishing machine steady temperature from transient tool-tip heat that this model cannot represent.
resonance|加工激振與結構頻率~Machining excitation and structural frequency|本單元用單自由度模型比較支承剛度與等效質量，指出自然頻率接近激振並不直接給出振幅。~Use a single-degree model to compare support stiffness and effective mass, noting that proximity to excitation frequency does not directly determine amplitude.
wear|刀具磨耗與輪廓~Tool wear and profile quality|本單元比較刀具使用次數與輪廓殘差，檢查材料硬點是否讓固定線性磨耗率失去代表性。~Compare tool-use count with profile residuals, checking whether hard material spots make a constant linear wear rate unrepresentative.
rss|輪廓量測誤差合成~Combining profile-measurement uncertainty|本單元分離輪廓掃描重複性與夾持基準偏差，避免把同一基準的相關誤差當成獨立來源。~Separate profile-scanner repeatability from clamping-datum bias, avoiding treatment of errors sharing one reference as independent sources.
wheel_sampling|輪面缺陷取樣間距~Sampling intervals for wheel defects|本單元直接使用假想輪面圓周速度計算掃描間距，另外檢查徑向振動和感測頻寬以免把資料間距誤當缺陷解析度。~Use assumed wheel-surface circumferential speed directly to calculate scan spacing, then check radial vibration and sensor bandwidth rather than equating sample spacing with defect resolution.
test_time|加工後驗證完整工時~Complete post-machining verification effort|本單元將輪徑、輪廓、圓度與資料歸檔視為不同驗證工作，將量具重設和異常重測納入節拍。~Treat diameter, profile, roundness and archiving as separate verification tasks, including gauge reset and anomaly reruns in the cycle.
coverage|輪型與缺陷案例矩陣~Wheel-type and defect case matrix|本單元對不同輪型、偏磨與表面缺陷建立案例，明列未加工過的組合以限制品質推論。~Build cases for wheel types, uneven wear and surface defects, listing unmachined combinations explicitly to bound quality claims.
''')
